  "details": "# Issue:\n\nThe newly added \"Maximum Estimated Memory Usage\" is a really nice setting to have, but it's really annoying to change the value, as it only goes in 5mb increments. This makes it really hard and annoying to change it to something lower like 150mb.\n\n# Suggestion:  \n\nAllow us to directly enter a number.\n\nThis could be done by opening a key pad when clicking on the number directly.\n\n# Attachments:  \n\nHere is a video showcasing the issue:\n\nhttps://files.catbox.moe/9gnyej.mp4",
